  "title": "Here, there and with me",
  "goal": "Say here and there, put endings on names, and say what you have with you.",
  "points": ["gp-place-words", "gp-proper-nouns", "gp-bar-yok"],
  "intro": {
    "text": "Names take endings with no apostrophe: *Aşgabatda*, *Londonda*. The pronouns take the locative too: *mende*, *sende*, *onda*. With *bar* and *ýok* they say what someone has with them: *Mende pul ýok* (I have no money on me).",
    "see": "gp-place-words"
  },
